T1  - Bilateral theta burst stimulation for patients with acute unipolar or bipolar depressive episodes: A systematic review of randomized controlled studies.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.jad.2023.08.065
A1  - Qin, Zhen-Juan
A1  - Huang, Shan-Qing
A1  - Lan, Xian-Jun
