T1  - Non-invasive brain stimulation and computational models in post-stroke aphasic patients: single session of transcranial magnetic stimulation and transcranial direct current stimulation. A randomized clinical trial.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1590/1516-3180.2016.0194060617
A1  - Santos, Michele Devido Dos
A1  - Cavenaghi, Vitor Breseghello
A1  - Mac-Kay, Ana Paula Machado Goyano
